:"Successfully wrote 24 bytes to /Users/jmewing/.openclaw/workspace/lux-mon/docker/requirements.txt"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1785560205829},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.write:27","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Quick Start\n\n## Run InfluxDB + Grafana locally\n\n```bash\ncd docker\ndocker compose up -d\n```\n\n- InfluxDB: http://localhost:8086  (luxmon / lux-mon-password)\n- Grafana:  http://localhost:3000   (luxmon / lux-mon-password)\n\n## Run the collector\n\n```bash\n# Native Python\npython3 -m collector.collector\n\n# Or with a config file\npython3 -m collector.collector config/collector.py\n```\n\n## Verify data\n\n```bash\ncurl -G 'http://localhost:8086/query?db=solar' \\\n  --data-urlencode 'q=SELECT * FROM inverter ORDER BY time DESC LIMIT 1'\n```\n\n## Stop\n\n```bash\ncd docker\ndocker compose down\n```\n","path":"/Users/jmewing/.openclaw/workspace/lux-mon/docker/README.md"}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"kimi-k2.7-code:cloud","usage":{"input":54177,"output":224,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54401,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1785560209263},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.write:27","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 582 bytes to /Users/jmewing/.openclaw/workspace/lux-mon/docker/README.md"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1785560209304},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I need to make the collector load config from environment variables, and add a CLI to make it runnable as a module. Let me update collector.py:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.edit:28","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/Users/jmewing/.openclaw/workspace/lux-mon/collector/collector.py","edits":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"kimi-k2.7-code:cloud","usage":{"in